@InquiryService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Submit an inquiry (fresh request)
POST {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "reference": "REF-001"
}

### Submit the same inquiry again (served from cache)
POST {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "reference": "REF-001"
}

### Bypass the cache to force a fresh provider run
POST {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inquiries?bypassCache=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "reference": "REF-001"
}

### Invalid request (should return 400)
POST {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "PROD-001"
}

### List fake providers and their current scenarios
GET {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/providers

### Make Alpha technically fail, then submit -> Beta should serve
PUT {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/providers/Alpha/scenario?scenario=TechnicalFailure

### Make Alpha time out, then submit -> Beta should serve
PUT {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/providers/Alpha/scenario?scenario=Timeout

### Make Alpha return a business error, then submit -> Beta must NOT be tried
PUT {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/providers/Alpha/scenario?scenario=BusinessError

### Reset both providers back to success
PUT {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/providers/Alpha/scenario?scenario=Success
PUT {{InquiryService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/providers/Beta/scenario?scenario=Success